## 🛠️ Installation
```bash
# Clone repo
$ git clone https://github.com/yourusername/MAGT-Inpainting.git
$ cd MAGT-Inpainting

# Install dependencies
$ pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## 🚀 Training
```bash
python train.py --config configs/train_config.yaml
```

### 🔧 Hyperparameters
| Parameter | Value |
|-----------|--------|
| Optimizer | Adam |
| Learning Rate | 2e-4 |
| β₁ / β₂ | 0.5 / 0.999 |
| Epochs | 100 |
| Batch Size | 16 |
| Loss Weights | λ₁ = 1.0, λ₂ = 0.1, λ₃ = 0.05, λ₄ = 0.2 |
| Input Size | 256×256 |

---

## 🧪 Evaluation
```bash
python test.py --dataset ADE20K --checkpoint path_to_weights.pth
```

Evaluation metrics:
- PSNR
- SSIM
- FID

